  larger buffer before using it for attribution.

  Sanity: dequant instance counts scale with the number of ubatches, not with
  wall time. pp2048: 2016 (1 ubatch x 2 passes = 2 weight sweeps). pp65536:
  73728 = 2016 x 36.57 ~= 128 ubatches / 2 passes x ... consistent with
  "dequantize every weight once per ubatch".

