================================================================
methodology notes
================================================================
* r=1 is unreliable and biased low. Same config (pp16384/ub=2048) measured
  850.93 (r=1), 810.47 (r=1), 861.12 +- 8.11 (r=3), 867.68 +- 35.80 (r=3).
* Never run two benches on the GPU concurrently: one job failed outright from
  contention; another produced the high 850.93 outlier.
* `pgrep -f llama-bench` matches the ssh command line itself (it contains the
  string "llama-bench") and kills the remote shell -> exit 255. Use `pkill -x`.
* Defaults: n_ubatch = 512 (common/common.h:469), n_batch = 2048 (llama-bench),
  n_ubatch = min(n_batch, n_ubatch) (src/llama-context.cpp:281).
